  "description": "The Zero 29. No compromises. The versatile Bird Zero makes a comeback with 29\" wheels and even more speed. Just like the original, this one is capable of running a 20mm fork range (120mm-140mm) and just like the original, we're loading this up with only the best parts. Designed around a 29 x 2.5 or 2.6 tyre this long, low and slack trail bike can still mix it on the DH tracks, while keeping the weight to a minimum.Anyone can make an aluminium hardtail, but only when you buy a Bird do you know that every component on the bike is carefully selected to offer long life, great weight to strength ratios, and the highest levels of performance.\n\nComes complete with a stealth rear axle and derailleur hanger.",
